00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:29.650
I didn't know what to do and then
I remembered Coach Hosokawa.

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:35.740
Long ago, he had to retire from
the game due to bad health...

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:38.030
...and I thought he would understand how I felt.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:40.710
The two of us started meeting up after that.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.640
And foolish me,

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.580
I fell in love with your father.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.180
Fell... in love?

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:54.450
I should have told you upfront
instead of running away.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:57.980
Even if you wouldn't forgive me,
even if you hated me...

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:01.000
I fell in love with your father,

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.550
because he's a wonderful man.

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:08.030
I've made you suffer because of me.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.800
I'm sorry, Kanako.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.900
Yuko-senpai...

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:24.410
I knew it, too!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:29.680
That my father granted my mother's
wish to continue working.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:34.900
That the reason he left was because of
the stress from Mother's work...

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.190
...and it was something they
had discussed with each other.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.060
Yuko-senpai...

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:41.670
Kanako...

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:45.870
The reason Kanako-chan
hated men was because...

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:49.840
...she thought her father had ruined her
favorite upperclassman's life...

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.780
...and she found that unforgivable.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:57.680
Kanako...

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:01.250
Kanako-chan will be fine now, right?

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:20.100
We were changing her diaper in here earlier.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.530
Then, the reason you came to
the nurse's office was...

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:26.380
She's your little sister, Kanako.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.610
Her name is Chikako.

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.820
My... little sister?

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:35.290
Try holding her.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.590
What?

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:53.230
Case closed!

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:56.210
Now, shall we go wander around?

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:58.340
Yes, since it's not even 1:30 yet.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.600
Oh, no! "Little Women"!

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:02.980
Go on ahead!

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.250
Right!

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.390
Why is she in such a rush?

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:12.290
A first-year student who helps
out with the Yamayuri Council...

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.960
...is appearing in the Drama Club's play.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.930
Oh, that electric drill, huh?

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:20.860
This thing deserves to get burned!

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.000
Amy!

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:27.770
Toko-chan's Amy was spirited and wonderful.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:28.710
How could you do that?!

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:30.110
How could you do that?!
Impudent at times, stubborn at others...

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.250
This is a precious book!
Impudent at times, stubborn at others...

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:31.780
This is a precious book!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.510
She put in an appealing performance
playing adorable Amy.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:42.980
Lillian School
Festival
Theater Related
Personnel
Greenroom

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:46.250
Onee-sama?

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:49.530
Would it be all right if I were
a bit late arriving backstage?

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:50.930
That would be fine.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:52.820
Thank you very much.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.030
Toko-chan, you were great.

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.810
This, from the person who came late.

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:01.670
Oh, you noticed?

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:04.710
But I got here before you spoke your first lines.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.840
I am going to change,
so please get out of my way.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:10.650
What is it?

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.120
So, Toko-chan, once you take that off,

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.280
are you going to get straight into
your "Changelings" costume?

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.850
Of course...

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.350
Then how about you just
go out looking like that?

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:20.590
Huh?

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.790
You promised me, remember?

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.460
That you'd be my guide?

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.430
N-Now?

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:27.190
Yup!

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:51.810
Yumi-san...

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:53.750
And Toko-chan, too?

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.360
Hurry, Toko-chan!

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.530
That stupid promise...

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:08.180
No problem!

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:08.840
No problem!
The Yamayuri version of "The Changelings"...

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.310
Sister!
The Yamayuri version of "The Changelings"...

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:10.580
The Yamayuri version of "The Changelings"...

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:11.180
...began with a huge roar of laughter.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:12.310
Look up.
...began with a huge roar of laughter.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.480
Yes, my lord.
Yes, my lord.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:20.420
I am such a fortunate man.

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:23.380
My two wives have borne
me a son and a daughter.

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:27.690
M-My dear children both take after
their mothers and are beautiful.

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.490
Oh, my.
Oh, my.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:35.230
Kanako-chan was still unable
to deliver her lines smoothly,

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:39.800
but it seemed like her expression had
softened a little compared to before.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:03.920
You spend the closing party night
alone every year, don't you?

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:08.230
And you come find me every year,
don't you, Onee-sama?

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:10.730
Am I disturbing you?

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:12.370
Not at all.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:17.540
Yumi.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:18.630
Y-Yes?

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:21.640
Why don't we walk for a bit?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:39.030
It will have been exactly one year
since we became soeurs, won't it?

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.100
Yes.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.170
You see, Yumi,

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.570
I had no intention of doing
anything special tonight.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.980
It's not that I had forgotten.

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:53.610
And it's different from
your birthday or White Day,

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:55.480
when I had a hard time doing anything for you,

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.540
even as I felt like I ought to do something.

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:01.110
Do you know why?

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:06.930
Because to me,

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.830
it's not as if today alone is special.

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:16.730
I mean, you will still be my little
sister tomorrow and the day after that.

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:20.570
Just as you have been and
just as you will be from now on.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.410
To me, today is not special in any way.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.940
Just an ordinary day, the same as yesterday.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:36.610
Do you understand what I am saying?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.890
My eyes have opened to the truth
and tears have come out.

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:43.700
How silly of you.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:05.580
Yumi.

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:10.780
Find a little sister.

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:12.220
What?

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:17.130
My dear sister is a liar.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:21.000
For she said it was an ordinary
day with nothing special about it,

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:23.900
but on this day, one year
since we became soeurs,

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:27.270
she gave me an assignment
that was far from easy.

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:47.790
A winterscape where even...
Machi no irodori sae doko

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:52.490
...the town's colors seem forlorn somehow
to naku samishige na fuyu no keshiki

00:22:52.730 --> 00:22:56.540
I think of you, turning your back on me...
Senaka mise kaketeitta

00:22:56.540 --> 00:23:00.270
...and running off
anata o omou

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:05.280
There's a clear square pane...
Futari no aida ni wa

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.280
...between the two of us
toumei na shikakkei

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:12.020
It's misted over right now...
Ima wa kasunderu

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:18.620
...with the crystals of sighs
tame-iki no kesshou de

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:23.300
Window glass, window glass
Mado garasu mado garasu

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:29.240
It's clouded and I can't see you
Kumottete anata ga mienai no

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:35.140
Even though I know that you're there
Soko ni iru koto wa wakatteiru no ni

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:39.180
Are you smiling? Are you crying?
Waratteru naiteru no

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:45.190
I don't even care if you're frowning, let me see you
Shikamettsura demo ii kara misete

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:53.650
Wipe the glass from your side, too
Sochira no hou kara mo garasu o fuite

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:07.510
Preview

00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:08.340
Preview
Noriko-chan,

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:10.780
Preview
you have an upperclassman-like
air of dignity about you already.

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:12.750
Preview
What? Rei-sama, that is absurd!

00:24:12.750 --> 00:24:15.950
Preview
It's true. My little sister is still so childish.

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:17.880
Preview
The same could be said of my little sister as well.

00:24:17.880 --> 00:24:19.420
Preview
Rei-sama and Sachiko-sama,

00:24:19.420 --> 00:24:22.190
Preview
I imagine once Yoshino-san and
Yumi-san both find their petite soeurs,

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:24.220
Preview
they will naturally become steadier.

00:24:24.220 --> 00:24:25.690
Preview
Oh, I don't know about that.

00:24:25.690 --> 00:24:26.490
Preview
You don't know? But Onee-sama,

00:24:26.490 --> 00:24:27.860
Preview
You don't know? But Onee-sama,
The Soeur Audition

00:24:27.860 --> 00:24:31.230
Preview
who was the one who pressured
me to find a little sister?!
The Soeur Audition

00:24:31.230 --> 00:24:32.830
Preview
Next time, "The Soeur Audition."
The Soeur Audition

00:24:32.830 --> 00:24:35.170
Preview
How are you supposed to find a little sister?
The Soeur Audition

